# 🧠 Prompt Showcase for TCRGoogle

This repository contains a collection of prompts used in the development and evaluation of **TCRGoogle**, an explainable framework for T-cell receptor (TCR)–antigen specificity prediction.

Each prompt is designed to guide large language models (LLMs) in specific sub-tasks, including:

- Antigen retrieval from domain-specific documents (Strategy I)
- Interpretability scoring and reasoning evaluation

Prompts are provided with input/output examples and can be adapted for related biomedical generative tasks.

